{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-87147","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-121026","text":"Workbench"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87149","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121027","text":"Crystallize agent behavior into replayable skills."}]}],"id":"blk-87148","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-87150","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121028","text":"A skill workshop and proof harness for the [&] Stack. Teach an agent once, capture every observable step, and turn the trace into a signed, replayable "},{"id":"spn-121029","marks":["bold"],"text":"SkillBundle"},{"id":"spn-121030","text":" that PRISM can score and that any [&] body (browser / host / simulator) can re-execute."}]},{"id":"blk-87151","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-121031","text":"Why Workbench exists"}]},{"id":"blk-87152","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121032","text":"The [&] Stack has eleven protocols (OS-001..OS-011), nine MCP servers, and roughly five hundred Elixir / TypeScript tests showing the parts work in isolation. What it didn't have — until now — was a "},{"id":"spn-121033","marks":["italic"],"text":"user-facing"},{"id":"spn-121034","text":" artifact that exercises the whole pipeline and produces something a person actually wants. Workbench is that artifact."}]},{"id":"blk-87153","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121035","text":"A SkillBundle is valuable to the user (a reusable, replayable thing they can share). The same JSON is valuable to PRISM (it satisfies the EvidenceBundle contract from "},{"id":"spn-121036","marks":["code"],"text":"STACK_ARCHITECTURE_GAP_REVIEW.md"},{"id":"spn-121037","text":" Finding 8). Two audiences, one file."}]},{"id":"blk-87154","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121038","text":"See "},{"id":"spn-121039","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/workbench/docs/spec/README.md"}],"text":"`docs/spec/README.md`"},{"id":"spn-121040","text":" for the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-87155","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-121041","text":"Layout"}]},{"id":"blk-87156","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"workbench/\n├── docs/spec/                   # authoritative v0.1 spec + 6 JSON schemas\n├── fixtures/scenarios/          # 5 canonical fixture scenarios\n├── app/                         # SvelteKit static app (Cloudflare Pages)\n│   ├── src/lib/\n│   │   ├── types.ts             # TypeScript mirrors of every schema\n│   │   ├── hash.ts              # canonical JSON + sha256 + bundleContentHash\n│   │   ├── storage.ts           # IndexedDB + sessionStorage\n│   │   ├── openrouter.ts        # BYO-key chat client (via /api/llm/openrouter)\n│   │   ├── trace.ts             # InteractionTrace builder\n│   │   ├── mcp/                 # streamable-HTTP MCP client + per-server wrappers\n│   │   └── bundle/              # builder / verify / replay\n│   └── src/routes/              # +layout, +page (landing), teach, skills, compare, prism, import\n└── functions/\n    ├── llm/openrouter.ts        # CF Pages Function: OpenRouter pass-through\n    ├── mcp/                     # CF Pages Functions: delegatic / body-browser / prism MCP proxies\n    └── prism/leaderboard.ts     # CF Pages Function: PRISM read-only leaderboard proxy"},{"id":"blk-87157","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-121042","text":"Status"}]},{"id":"blk-87158","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121043","marks":["bold"],"text":"v0.3.0-alpha"},{"id":"spn-121044","text":" — Invariant Arithmetic v0.3 is wired into the verifier and replay surface. Every proof gate's verdict is now computed by an "},{"id":"spn-121045","marks":["code"],"text":"InvariantArithmetic.consume(value, requirements)"},{"id":"spn-121046","text":" call ("},{"id":"spn-121047","marks":["code"],"text":"app/src/lib/ia/"},{"id":"spn-121048","text":"), and every gate carries "},{"id":"spn-121049","marks":["code"],"text":"law"},{"id":"spn-121050","text":" (e.g. "},{"id":"spn-121051","marks":["code"],"text":"'L12/L14'"},{"id":"spn-121052","text":") and "},{"id":"spn-121053","marks":["code"],"text":"invariant_family"},{"id":"spn-121054","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-121055","marks":["code"],"text":"topological | spatial | temporal | governance"},{"id":"spn-121056","text":") annotations. Replay surprise signals carry the same projection. The three relevant JSON schemas (PROOF_RESULT, REPLAY_REPORT, EVIDENCE_BUNDLE) declare the optional "},{"id":"spn-121057","marks":["code"],"text":"law"},{"id":"spn-121058","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-121059","marks":["code"],"text":"invariant_family"},{"id":"spn-121060","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-121061","marks":["code"],"text":"ia_substrate"},{"id":"spn-121062","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-121063","marks":["code"],"text":"invariants"},{"id":"spn-121064","text":" fields."}]},{"id":"blk-87159","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121065","marks":["bold"],"text":"v0.2.3 baseline"},{"id":"spn-121066","text":" — authority gate supports "},{"id":"spn-121067","marks":["code"],"text":"delegatic-mcp"},{"id":"spn-121068","text":" HMAC/TTL verification when enabled, "},{"id":"spn-121069","marks":["code"],"text":"body-browser-mcp"},{"id":"spn-121070","text":" is wired for browser-body teach flows, and the PRISM page stages SkillBundle hand-off by "},{"id":"spn-121071","marks":["code"],"text":"content_hash"},{"id":"spn-121072","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-87160","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121073","text":"Persisted bundles are now self-describing: "},{"id":"spn-121074","marks":["code"],"text":"verifyBundle"},{"id":"spn-121075","text":" returns an "},{"id":"spn-121076","marks":["code"],"text":"ia_substrate"},{"id":"spn-121077","text":" block (version + "},{"id":"spn-121078","marks":["code"],"text":"laws_exercised"},{"id":"spn-121079","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-121080","marks":["code"],"text":"families_exercised"},{"id":"spn-121081","text":" projected from the gates' annotations) which the teach flow stamps into "},{"id":"spn-121082","marks":["code"],"text":"bundle.proof.ia_substrate"},{"id":"spn-121083","text":" before re-sealing the "},{"id":"spn-121084","marks":["code"],"text":"content_hash"},{"id":"spn-121085","text":". The compare flow leaves it ephemeral (no persistence)."}]},{"id":"blk-87161","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121086","text":"113 / 113 vitest tests pass as of 2026-05-27 (95 v0.2 + 15 IA law properties at 1000 trials each + 3 IA annotation/substrate tests). "},{"id":"spn-121087","marks":["code"],"text":"npm run check"},{"id":"spn-121088","text":" has 23 known TypeScript/Svelte diagnostics inherited from v0.2.3 (no new diagnostics from the IA work); do not present the app as typecheck-clean until those are resolved."}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-87163","spans":[{"id":"spn-121089","text":"Surface"}]},{"id":"blk-87164","spans":[{"id":"spn-121090","text":"Status"}]}],"id":"blk-87162","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-87165","spans":[{"id":"spn-121091","text":"JSON schemas (6)"}]},{"id":"blk-87166","spans":[{"id":"spn-121092","text":"✅ complete + IA-annotated"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87167","spans":[{"id":"spn-121093","text":"Fixture scenarios"}]},{"id":"blk-87168","spans":[{"id":"spn-121094","text":"✅ 5 / 5"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87169","spans":[{"id":"spn-121095","text":"SvelteKit app shell"}]},{"id":"blk-87170","spans":[{"id":"spn-121096","text":"✅ scaffolded"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87171","spans":[{"id":"spn-121097","text":"Teach (simulator)"}]},{"id":"blk-87172","spans":[{"id":"spn-121098","text":"✅ end-to-end"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87173","spans":[{"id":"spn-121099","text":"Fixture chooser"}]},{"id":"blk-87174","spans":[{"id":"spn-121100","text":"✅ 5 / 5 (AC #3)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87175","spans":[{"id":"spn-121101","text":"Crystallize bundle"}]},{"id":"blk-87176","spans":[{"id":"spn-121102","text":"✅ working"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87177","spans":[{"id":"spn-121103","text":"Bundle verify"}]},{"id":"blk-87178","spans":[{"id":"spn-121104","text":"✅ 6 / 6 gates, IA-derived (v0.3)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87179","spans":[{"id":"spn-121105","text":"Bundle replay"}]},{"id":"blk-87180","spans":[{"id":"spn-121106","text":"✅ deterministic, IA-annotated surprises (v0.3)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87181","spans":[{"id":"spn-121107","text":"Redaction profiles"}]},{"id":"blk-87182","spans":[{"id":"spn-121108","text":"✅ none / transcript_pii / full"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87183","spans":[{"id":"spn-121109","text":"Compare tab (2 models)"}]},{"id":"blk-87184","spans":[{"id":"spn-121110","text":"✅ AC #13 (live LLM)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87185","spans":[{"id":"spn-121111","text":"Live manifest validation"}]},{"id":"blk-87186","spans":[{"id":"spn-121112","text":"✅ AC #6"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87187","spans":[{"id":"spn-121113","text":"Cross-session re-import"}]},{"id":"blk-87188","spans":[{"id":"spn-121114","text":"✅ AC #8"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87189","spans":[{"id":"spn-121115","text":"Body-browser teach"}]},{"id":"blk-87190","spans":[{"id":"spn-121116","text":"✅ v0.2.2 (perceive + encode_state edges)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87191","spans":[{"id":"spn-121117","text":"Delegatic authority"}]},{"id":"blk-87192","spans":[{"id":"spn-121118","text":"✅ v0.2.1 (put_policy → authorize → verify)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87193","spans":[{"id":"spn-121119","text":"PRISM connectivity"}]},{"id":"blk-87194","spans":[{"id":"spn-121120","text":"✅ v0.2.3 (leaderboard + list_systems + bundle hand-off)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87195","spans":[{"id":"spn-121121","text":"Invariant Arithmetic"}]},{"id":"blk-87196","spans":[{"id":"spn-121122","text":"✅ v0.3.0 (15 laws, 1000-trial property tests, "},{"id":"spn-121123","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-121124","text":"-derived gates)"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-87197","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-121125","text":"Develop"}]},{"id":"blk-87198","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"cd app\nnpm install\nnpm run dev    # http://localhost:5180"},{"id":"blk-87199","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121126","text":"The dev server expects an OpenRouter key in "},{"id":"spn-121127","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionStorage"},{"id":"spn-121128","text":" (set via the landing page). For local development without a real proxy, set up a Vite middleware that forwards "},{"id":"spn-121129","marks":["code"],"text":"/api/llm/openrouter/*"},{"id":"spn-121130","text":" to "},{"id":"spn-121131","marks":["code"],"text":"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/*"},{"id":"spn-121132","text":", or configure Cloudflare's "},{"id":"spn-121133","marks":["code"],"text":"wrangler pages dev"},{"id":"spn-121134","text":" to mount "},{"id":"spn-121135","marks":["code"],"text":"functions/"},{"id":"spn-121136","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-87200","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-121137","text":"Deploy"}]},{"id":"blk-87201","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121138","text":"Cloudflare Pages, zero-budget tier. The static SvelteKit build lives under "},{"id":"spn-121139","marks":["code"],"text":"app/build/"},{"id":"spn-121140","text":"; the Pages Function under "},{"id":"spn-121141","marks":["code"],"text":"functions/"},{"id":"spn-121142","text":" is auto-discovered."}]},{"id":"blk-87202","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-121143","text":"Specs that matter here"}]},{"id":"blk-87203","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87205","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121144","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-121145","text":" — Workbench v0.1 spec (authoritative)"}]}],"id":"blk-87204","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87207","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121146","marks":["code"],"text":"../AmpersandBoxDesign/SPEC.md"},{"id":"spn-121147","text":" — [&] Protocol"}]}],"id":"blk-87206","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87209","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121148","marks":["code"],"text":"../PULSE/schemas/pulse-loop-manifest.v0.1.json"},{"id":"spn-121149","text":" — PULSE manifests"}]}],"id":"blk-87208","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87211","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121150","marks":["code"],"text":"../PRISM/docs/"},{"id":"spn-121151","text":" — PRISM benchmark contract"}]}],"id":"blk-87210","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87213","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121152","marks":["code"],"text":"../STACK_ARCHITECTURE_GAP_REVIEW.md"},{"id":"spn-121153","text":" Finding 8 — the Evidence Bundle gap this closes"}]}],"id":"blk-87212","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraxxzg4u25wv4tpr4w3jrggag33jptb3bvlexqzmhem4crwr5vniaq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}